Alembic migrations for IT InternTrack.

The database URL is taken from the application settings (DATABASE_URL), not
from alembic.ini.

  alembic upgrade head              apply all migrations
  alembic downgrade -1              roll back one
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the change"
  alembic current                   show the applied revision
  alembic history --verbose         show the migration chain

render_as_batch is enabled for SQLite because SQLite cannot ALTER most
constraints in place; batch mode recreates the table instead.
